  "files": [
    {
      "section": "Clinical Analysis",
      "unlock": "Unlocked at 25 trust",
      "description": "Imaging tests reveal clear, normal outlines of internal organs, and no abnormal shadows have been detected. Originium granules have not been detected in the circulatory system and there is no sign of infection. At this time, this Operator is believed to be non-infected. \n\n[Cell-Originium Assimilation] 0% \nOperator Croissant showed no symptoms of Oripathy. \n\n[Blood Originium-Crystal Density] 0.12u/L \nOperator Croissant sometimes delivers packages or sells goods with Originium content, but it has not caused infection to date."
    },
    {
      "section": "Archive File 1",
      "unlock": "Unlocked at 50 trust",
      "description": "An energetic messenger. \nShe believes that the purpose of work is to improve one's quality of life, and that shopping is the best way to improve her life. \nShe isn't hung up on money, but she does enjoy living paycheck-to-paycheck while jumping on opportunities to make a quick profit. She can often be seen hawking goods in various places."
    },
    {
      "section": "Archive File 2",
      "unlock": "Unlocked at 100 trust",
      "description": "Messengers usually get two kinds of work: Delivering mail and messages, or transporting cargo. \nThe former requires speed; the latter, strength and endurance. In Penguin Logistics, Croissant was an obvious stand-out in the latter. \nAlso notable, Croissant is extraordinarily strong even for a Forte. Swinging a hefty hammer in one hand while carrying a heavy shield in the other is as simple as breathing to her."
    },
    {
      "section": "Archive File 3",
      "unlock": "Unlocked at 150 trust",
      "description": "While not a big operation, Penguin Logistics is well-connected at all levels in Lungmen. \nThus, taking advantage of the channels back home, Croissant's irregular hawking ventures could be a treasure trove that just might offer rarities you wouldn't find anywhere else. \nOf course, don't let Croissant know if you did spot a valuable item, or she will wring your wallet."
    },
    {
      "section": "Archive File 4",
      "unlock": "Unlocked at 200 trust",
      "description": "Even as an Operator, Croissant has no plans to give up her hobbies and interests. \nShe knows an Operator will face unprecedented danger and see many unfortunate events. Nevertheless, she is still a city girl who counts her pennies. \nMaybe Rhodes Island recruits civilian Operators because they're not jaded and thus fearless, but it's definitely not because they should be exposed to the cruelty of the real world. It's more like the island have many unfortunate people who needed someone as adorable as Croissant to show them what a normal, blissful life is like. \nOf course, the unfortunate or hateful may begrudge the blessed, but at least it never happens at Rhodes Island."
    }
  ]
}
